			"Message": "fix(Mountain): update dialog options DTO structure and path formatting\n\nUpdate OpenDialog and SaveDialog handlers in CocoonService to match the updated Common library API:\n\n- Wrap dialog options in new nested `Base` field structure with `DialogOptionsDTO::DialogOptionsDTO` containing Title\n- Add explicit handler for `Ok(None)` case in OpenDialog to return empty array instead of implicit unit variant\n- Fix path string formatting to use `.display()` method for proper Path to String conversion\n\nThese changes resolve API mismatches between the Mountain gRPC implementation and the Common library's dialog option DTOs.",
